        "2. Temperature rise: ΔT = 75°C - 25°C = 50°C. Leakage doubles every 10°C: I_CBO(75°C) = I_CBO(25°C) · 2^(50/10) = 15 nA × 2⁵ = 15 nA × 32 = 480 nA = 0.48 μA.",
